<mxCell id="c_fig_2_18_101" value="&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size: 15px;&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figure 2.18 — Sequence Diagram: 3-Step Presigned S3/MinIO Attachment Upload (Max 500 MB + SHA-256) &amp; Record Search&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size: 11px; color: #444444;&#x27;&gt;Client-Side SHA-256 Hashing, 15-Minute Presigned S3 URL Direct Upload (Bypassing API), Verification &amp; Secure Download&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#000000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
